hub.com/users/Cuber98/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuber98/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuber98/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuber98/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuber98/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuber98/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cuber98/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-08T22:47:09Z","updated_at":"2025-07-08T22:47:09Z","body":"Also experienced on 4.4.1.stable","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3050484217/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3507541388","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101847#issuecomment-3507541388","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101847","id":3507541388,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7RENWM","user":{"login":"jaimejaime19","id":60041231,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDQxMjMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60041231?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaimejaime19","html_url":"https://github.com/jaimejaime19","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaimejaime19/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaimejaime19/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaimejaime19/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaimejaime19/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaimejaime19/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaimejaime19/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaimejaime19/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaimejaime19/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaimejaime19/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-09T05:23:34Z","updated_at":"2025-11-09T05:23:34Z","body":"Experienced on 4.5.1 stable when testing with MultiplayerSynchronizer and MultiplayerSpawner nodes. I found a workaround:\n* Example scene setup: CharacterBody3D with a script and 2 MultiplayerSync nodes. One for server synchronization (**ServerSync** - character position and rotation etc) and the other for client synchronization (**ClientSync** - player's mouse and keyboard input)\n* In the **ServerSync** node, synchronize **ClientSync:public_visibility**. Set 'Replicate' to 'On Change'.\n* Add a `teardown()` function in the character body's script.\n* In `teardown()`, set `public_visibility = false` on all MultiplayerSync nodes which have client authority. In this example, only ClientSync needs this set.\n* When you want to remove the replicated node on the server, do this:\n`\nnode.teardown()\nawait get_tree().physics_frame\nawait get_tree().physics_frame\nnode.queue_free()\n`\n\nWith a single await, you can still get an error by chance. With two awaits, I find that I don't get the error whatsoever in my local testing. Note that I awaited physics frames since that is what my ClientSync had its Visibility Update Mode set to in the inspector. I have not tested with Idle mode, so no guarantee. I still suspect this fix isn't foolproof, but its good enough.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3507541388/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3516657821","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101847#issueco